{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/4b9b08b90d3320f3a8faf73ecf989b99.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/8e68fa83f8e5a179cfd956a435547eaa.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/9f0d5c8b9ac9a8ee50e5ec1ecbce094d.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/2f27e7637370a970ab1eb874879f21ee.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit <i>Amborettio</i>, Wanech transformed his trusty C.A.N. into a cozy green-themed pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings. The place hums with synthwave tracks, punctuated by chiptune sound effects, giving it a playful retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>top-down, casual cooking sim with arcade twists</strong>, you\u2019ll serve hungry customers by cooking food in a unique way: as meals rain down the screen, hit the correct <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> keys in sequence to prepare each order. Master the rhythm of the kitchen and deliver every plate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody really knows why Wanech traded adventure for appetizers\u2014though rumor has it, it\u2019s all to raise awareness for <i>Amborettio</i>. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: keep the pub buzzing, the customers smiling, and the orders flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958040?t=1755531865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3958040?t=1755531865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/c2dd3db424147f31f6d9ca59dfa965b5100132ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755531865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/c2dd3db424147f31f6d9ca59dfa965b5100132ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755531865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/4b9b08b90d3320f3a8faf73ecf989b99.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/8e68fa83f8e5a179cfd956a435547eaa.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/9f0d5c8b9ac9a8ee50e5ec1ecbce094d.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/extras/2f27e7637370a970ab1eb874879f21ee.webp?t=1755531865\" width=42 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After wrapping up the hit <i>Amborettio</i>, Wanech transformed his trusty C.A.N. into a cozy green-themed pub serving brew, burgers, fries, and wings. The place hums with synthwave tracks, punctuated by chiptune sound effects, giving it a playful retro vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>top-down, casual cooking sim with arcade twists</strong>, you\u2019ll serve hungry customers by cooking food in a unique way: as meals rain down the screen, hit the correct <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> keys in sequence to prepare each order. Master the rhythm of the kitchen and deliver every plate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody really knows why Wanech traded adventure for appetizers\u2014though rumor has it, it\u2019s all to raise awareness for <i>Amborettio</i>. Whatever the reason, your mission is clear: keep the pub buzzing, the customers smiling, and the orders flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio</p>","developers":["Wanech"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958040/e206162ce85b68133050b98b72bbb8cbdf5a9fcc/header.jpg?t=1755531865","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Barron Tartaglia","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183341,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183341/movie480.mp4?t=1755531863","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183341/movie_max.mp4?t=1755531863"},"name":"Wanech's C.A.N. Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183341/77bdb7719830c128fe2e255545d32c31ec867a6c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755531863","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183341/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755531863","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183341/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755531863"}}],"name":"Wanech's C.A.N.","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Developed for Windows 10.<